	(text "FPGA VCCAUX\nZORUNLU"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 92 226 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.2 1.2)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "0c6699ad-509c-41d7-9ca4-2fa74ae06d21")
	)
	(text "AYRISTIRMA (NETLIST.md §1)\nher ECP5 VCC/VCCIO topu 100nF, viasi dogrudan duzleme · ECP5 toplu 4x10uF + 2x47uF\nADC AVDD x8 pin basina 100nF + toplu 10uF · ADC DRVDD x4 100nF\nVCXO 100nF + 10uF + FERRIT BONCUK · PHY 10uF X5R  (Y5V KULLANMA, datasheet s.46-53)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 250 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.3 1.3)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "1b04fb33-20b2-4c2e-9cf6-9b0b38fff7a6")
	)
	(text "ADC AVDD"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 147 226 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.2 1.2)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "2b6e1579-78f9-4367-acac-3d09c5ebd8ec")
	)
	(text "GUC BUTCESI ~2.8 W -> 12V'ta ~230 mA. 10 Ah aku ile ~40 saat.\nSaha modunda ikinci PHY yazilimdan kapatilabilir, 0.25 W kazanc."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 268 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.3 1.3)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "561efdeb-c2ba-428c-9d73-5512b21b0d4a")
	)
	(text "ADCLK846 VS\nZORUNLU 1.8V"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 367 226 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.2 1.2)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "68387d91-dbae-404a-ab8f-ba4fa5a56b47")
	)
	(text "HASSAS RAYLAR — her biri AYRI LDO, AYRI ADA. Anahtarlamalidan BESLENMEZ (§1)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 185 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "6971d19e-69f1-457c-81bc-ad2c4d64cdbe")
	)
	(text "ANA RAY +3V3 — TPS62130, 3-17V giris, 3A"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 100 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "6c5ae4a0-ee7d-4001-8cc5-2854c955e09e")
	)
	(text "PWR_FLAG sadece VIN_PROT'ta: o ray konnektorden geliyor, gercek guc\ncikisi pini yok. Regulator ciktilarina bayrak konursa ERC cakisma verir."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 130 62 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.2 1.2)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "6ef31152-11a3-4a9c-83b7-5a5d5b47451d")
	)
	(text "ADC DRVDD"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 202 226 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.2 1.2)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "72f75654-564e-42a9-a990-2396688672ca")
	)
	(text "+1V8\nFPGA VCCIO\nbanka 6/3"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30 219 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.2 1.2)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "771ab2cc-c714-4197-86a8-7705c2e85d44")
	)
	(text "Q1 kaynagi girise, drain VIN_PROT'a. Govde diyodu ters baglamada iletmiyor.\nR1 gate'i asagi ceker (P-kanal icin iletim), D2 Vgs'i 12V'ta sinirlar.\nTVS ve sigorta drain tarafinda — koruma yukun oncesinde."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 40 74 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.25 1.25)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "7a6647a7-989a-4949-97b9-9e7789291e07")
	)
	(text "FPGA CEKIRDEK +1V1 — TPS62130 #2"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 220 100 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "84867eab-8594-478a-8548-2e9d754ffeb0")
	)
	(text "VCXO — TEK\nbesleme, FERRIT"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 257 226 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.2 1.2)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "8c59b107-c8f7-4ebc-803c-155fe8127e75")
	)
	(text "GIRIS VE KORUMA — NETLIST.md §9\n9-18 V aku ya da tezgah kaynagi. Ters polarite sahada bir kere olur, yeter."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 16 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "9a5c0b10-fa59-47c5-a53d-653d9b42c03c")
	)
	(text "1.1V icin oran 0.375.  EN zinciri: U1 PG -> U2 EN,\nguc siralamasi VCC(1.1) once, sonra VCCAUX, sonra VCCIO."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 237 159 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.2 1.2)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "b83f21c5-ec2e-4c7d-8d6f-616140f40789")
	)
	(text "Vout = 0.8 x (1 + R3/R4).  3.3V icin oran 3.125\nL1, Cin ve Cout datasheet Tablo 8'den."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 37 159 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.2 1.2)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "d16fa196-def2-41dc-8a86-03d426fc6e9b")
	)
	(text "DAC AVDD"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 312 226 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.2 1.2)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "e21232ae-14bd-4c66-b379-fa1b603ab109")
	)
	(text "U6 (+3V3_CLK) VCXO'nun TEK beslemesi. Ferrit boncuk, ayri toprak adasi.\nBesleme gurultusu DOGRUDAN faz gurultusune donusuyor — manset spec burada."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 105 232 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.3 1.3)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "e218cfd8-ee45-4497-9d6f-90a9c7a61d22")
	)
	(text "U8 (+2V5) ECP5 VCCAUX. Ilk guc agacinda ATLANMISTI — FPGA'yi hic\ncalistirmayan turden bir eksik. ADP150AUJZ-2.5, LCSC C144257."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 105 244 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.25 1.25)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "e2994bc4-3b05-4faa-b5a4-dec4520d81fe")
	)
	(text "U9 (+1V8_CLK) ADCLK846'nin VS rayi. Veri sayfasi basligi:\n'1.8 V, 6 LVDS/12 CMOS Output Clock Fanout Buffer'. Saat bolumu\nbastan 3.3 V varsayilmisti — tampon o rayda calismaz."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
